sequenceDiagram
    participant FW as firmware
    participant LIB as uart_write()
    participant BUS as interconnect
    participant UART as UART @ 0xF000_3000
    participant OUT as your terminal
    FW->>LIB: printf("hello") sends 'h'
    LIB->>BUS: load 0xF000_3004 (txfull?)
    BUS->>UART: 0xF000_xxxx → CSR region → UART slot
    UART-->>LIB: 0, the FIFO has room
    LIB->>BUS: store 0x68 to 0xF000_3000
    BUS->>UART: byte enters the TX FIFO
    UART->>OUT: real chip: TX pin, simulator: serial2console
